 ### 2356 — Physical macOS MTU/socket baseline separates queue drops from send refusal (TASK-260715-gyg51r)
-- MEASUREMENT: The bounded loopback-only SPM harness ran 36 rows on a physical Apple M3 Max Mac (arm64, macOS 26.5): MTU 1500/4096/8500 × IPv4/native IPv6/dual stack × nominal/constrained-buffer/25ms receiver-stall/mixed bidirectional traffic. Nominal and mixed rows delivered 100%; pressure rows produced only named bounded effects and recovered with zero owned descriptor/task delta.
